---
import LiteCheckForm from "./LiteCheckForm.astro"
---
<section id="free-scan" class="lite-console" aria-labelledby="free-scan-heading">
  <div class="lite-console__layout">
    <div class="lite-console__entry">
      <h2 id="free-scan-heading">Start with a Lite Check.</h2>
      <p>A passive check of the public URL you authorize.</p>
      <LiteCheckForm />
      <a href="/scan" data-cta-id="premium-hero-lite-check" class="lite-console__link">Coverage &amp; limits</a>
    </div>
    <figure class="lite-sample">
      <figcaption>Illustrative Lite result</figcaption>
      <ul>
        <li><span>Security headers</span><strong class="is-warn">3 missing</strong></li>
        <li><span>Frontend data signals</span><strong class="is-warn">1 to review</strong></li>
        <li><span>HTTPS</span><strong class="is-pass">Clean</strong></li>
      </ul>
      <p>A passive check cannot prove your app has no vulnerabilities.</p>
      <a href="/tools" class="lite-console__link">Browser-local tools</a>
    </figure>
  </div>
</section>
<style>
.lite-console { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); align-content: center; padding: 4rem 1rem; scroll-margin-top: 5rem; }
.lite-console__layout { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, .85fr); align-items: center; gap: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 5rem); width: min(100%, 1152px); margin-inline: auto; padding: clamp(1.5rem, 4vw, 3.5rem); color: var(--text); background: var(--bg); border-radius: 1rem; }
h2 { max-width: 15ch; margin: 0 0 1rem; font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 3.5vw, 2.75rem); line-height: 1.15; letter-spacing: -.03em; text-wrap: balance; }
.lite-console__entry { min-width: 0; }
.lite-console__entry > p { max-width: 35ch; margin: 0; line-height: 1.65; color: var(--text-muted); }
.lite-console__link { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; min-height: 44px; margin-top: .5rem; color: var(--accent); font-size: .875rem; text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 4px; }
.lite-console__link:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--accent); outline-offset: 4px; }
.lite-sample { min-width: 0; margin: 0; padding: 1.5rem; background: var(--bg-raised); border-radius: .75rem; }
figcaption { margin-bottom: 1.25rem; color: var(--text-muted); font-size: .875rem; }
ul { padding: 0; margin: 0; list-style: none; }
li { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: .5rem 1rem; padding-block: 1.25rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); font-size: .875rem; }
li:first-child { border-top: 1px solid var(--border); }
strong { font-weight: 600; }
.is-warn { color: var(--terminal-warning-text); }
:global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .is-warn { color: #f5bc69; }
.is-pass { color: var(--accent); }
.lite-sample p { margin: 1.5rem 0 .5rem; max-width: 35ch; color: var(--text-muted); font-size: .875rem; line-height: 1.65; }
@media(max-width:1023px) { .lite-console__layout { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); max-width: 680px; } }
</style>
